+    "line": 7,
+    "why": "The ownership middleware is mounted with router.use('/invoices/:id'), and Router compiles every pattern to an anchored regex (^/invoices/([^/]+)$, src/router.js:13), so it does not match the longer path /invoices/:id/pdf. getInvoicePdf (src/invoices.js:25-29) only checks that the invoice exists, not who owns it. Signed in as Alice, this request returns 200 with a base64 PDF of Bob's invoice inv_1002 (customer cust_bob, Consulting 990.00). It also works for inv_1003."
+  },
